# Landing + demo backup

Marketing landing: `src/pages/LandingPage.*`  
Interactive demo: `ops/demo/` (outside Base44 — do not move into `src/`)

## After replacing `src/` and/or `base44/`

```bash
node ops/landing-backup/restore.mjs
```

Verify:

- `/` → LandingPage (Try Demo CTA when demo enabled)
- `/demo` → industry picker
- `/demo/app` → demo dashboard
- `/app` → real Dashboard (protected)
- Vite alias `@demo` → `ops/demo` in `vite.config.js`

Demo is on in local DEV always; production needs `VITE_ENABLE_DEMO=true`.
